    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Drop if 3rd digit of distcd = 2 or >= 6. Assign DivSeason = 0 if there was a dividend paid in the last 12 months. Replace DivSeason = 1 if the third digit of disctcd is 3, 0, or 1, and a positive dividend was paid 2, 5, 8, or 11 months ago, if the third digit is 4 and a dividend was paid 5 or 11 months ago, or if the third digit is 5 and a dividiend was paid 11 months ago. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=未写；PortfolioPeriod=1.0个月；StartMonth=12.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=LS port。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>5。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
